# Safari-ai-agent/.worktree-config
# Description: Per-repo worktree provisioning config for the global provisioner
#   ~/.ai-dev-dotfiles/tools/setup-worktree.sh. Consumed when starting isolated
#   branch work so agents never hand-roll `git worktree add` or switch HEAD in
#   the shared checkout.
# Author: Claude Code (Opus 5)
# Created: 2026-10-11
#
# This project has no Node package dependencies (see README "Run automated
# checks"), so there is nothing to install after creation. Gateway credentials
# live in .env.mac-tailscale, which is a real secret and is deliberately NOT
# listed in WT_CREDS — the launcher regenerates it per worktree on first run.
WT_BASE_BRANCH=main
WT_POST_CREATE=''
WT_CREDS=''
WT_PROFILE=none
